# Radicale htpasswd — bcrypt-hashed credentials
# Generate with:
#   htpasswd -Bc radicale/data/htpasswd admin
# Or via Docker:
#   docker run --rm -it tomsquest/docker-radicale htpasswd -Bc /tmp/htpasswd admin
# Then copy the output line into radicale/data/htpasswd
#
# Example entry (admin:admin — CHANGE THIS):
# admin:$2b$12$example bcrypt hash here